    "name": "HYPERBEAT",
    "steam_appid": 2263360,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Outrun eternity. Endlessly.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2263360/extras/10e11be810811968c145655dcd966c8e.poster.avif?t=1753713986\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2263360/extras/10e11be810811968c145655dcd966c8e.webm?t=1753713986\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2263360/extras/10e11be810811968c145655dcd966c8e.mp4?t=1753713986\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HYPERBEAT is a rhythm game with an original soundtrack, workshop support, and easy to learn but hard to master gameplay. Use your weapon of choice to slash your way through jungle and rave inspired beats, with each note flying at you indicating whether you slash, ride, or dodge your way through an endless dream.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2263360/extras/c1b8b8cc3ded06da1803ee3cbb8cfad9.poster.avif?t=1753713986\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2263360/extras/c1b8b8cc3ded06da1803ee3cbb8cfad9.webm?t=1753713986\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2263360/extras/c1b8b8cc3ded06da1803ee3cbb8cfad9.mp4?t=1753713986\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No rhythm game experience required! Play at your own pace.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a visually stunning space and meet the KNIGHTS that embody the WELLSPRING.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your KNIGHT as you progress through the adventure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original soundtrack with a progression system. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Custom charts with workshop integration will be available in the final release.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast paced rhythm gameplay with both mouse, controller, and tablet support.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Difficulties and accessibility options to tailor your gaming experience to your preferences.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2263360/extras/444abc282dd080b173e76f04885792ff.poster.avif?t=1753713986\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2263360/extras/444abc282dd080b173e76f04885792ff.webm?t=1753713986\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2263360/extras/444abc282dd080b173e76f04885792ff.mp4?t=1753713986\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Outrun eternity. Endlessly.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2263360/extras/10e11be810811968c145655dcd966c8e.poster.avif?t=1753713986\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2263360/extras/10e11be810811968c145655dcd966c8e.webm?t=1753713986\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2263360/extras/10e11be810811968c145655dcd966c8e.mp4?t=1753713986\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HYPERBEAT is a rhythm game with an original soundtrack, workshop support, and easy to learn but hard to master gameplay. Use your weapon of choice to slash your way through jungle and rave inspired beats, with each note flying at you indicating whether you slash, ride, or dodge your way through an endless dream.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2263360/extras/c1b8b8cc3ded06da1803ee3cbb8cfad9.poster.avif?t=1753713986\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2263360/extras/c1b8b8cc3ded06da1803ee3cbb8cfad9.webm?t=1753713986\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2263360/extras/c1b8b8cc3ded06da1803ee3cbb8cfad9.mp4?t=1753713986\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No rhythm game experience required! Play at your own pace.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a visually stunning space and meet the KNIGHTS that embody the WELLSPRING.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your KNIGHT as you progress through the adventure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original soundtrack with a progression system. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Custom charts with workshop integration will be available in the final release.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast paced rhythm gameplay with both mouse, controller, and tablet support.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Difficulties and accessibility options to tailor your gaming experience to your preferences.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2263360/extras/444abc282dd080b173e76f04885792ff.poster.avif?t=1753713986\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2263360/extras/444abc282dd080b173e76f04885792ff.webm?t=1753713986\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2263360/extras/444abc282dd080b173e76f04885792ff.mp4?t=1753713986\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "short_description": "A rhythm game like no other. With an original soundtrack, fast paced gameplay, and unmatched heart, HYPERBEAT is a unique thrill for rhythm game veterans and rookies alike.",
